==English==

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|la-new|thyroides}}, from {{der|en|grc|θυρεοειδής||shield-shaped}}, from {{af|grc|θυρεός|-ειδής|t1=oblong shield|t2=-form, -like|nocat=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|en|/ˈθaɪɹɔɪ̯d/}}
* {{a|GA}} {{IPA|en|/ˈθaɪɹɔɪ̯d/}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɔɪd}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}
# {{lb|en|anatomy}} Of, relating to, or being the [[thyroid gland]].
## Suggestive of a disordered thyroid gland.
##: ''a '''thyroid''' personality''
# {{lb|en|anatomy}} Of, relating to, or being the chief [[cartilage]] of the [[larynx]].
#: '''''thyroid''' cartilage''

